you comes down the stair into the hedge.
The Hedge (sidewinder, 8 by 8, seed 7). Find the far gate. Type help for the words.
The Mouth of the Hedge
A stair goes up behind you. A plate is set in the hedge beside it.
North, the way runs one pace and turns left.
> look
The Mouth of the Hedge
A stair goes up behind you. A plate is set in the hedge beside it.
North, the way runs one pace and turns left.
> read
A long walk runs along the north edge. The rows below are broken into runs.
> study
Every row is runs of squares, and every run has one gate north. Go up to the long walk, along it, and down. The way down is the only way.
> north
Ring 1 of the Hedge
South, the way runs one pace to a dead end.
West, the way runs two paces with an opening on the left at one and turns right.
