> score
1 turns. 29 turns of light and 2 torches to come. Facing north.
> cast (go sideways)
The spell does not hold (chibi): (go sideways): go needs one direction: north east south west ahead back left right up down
> cast
Type the spell. A blank line ends it.
  . (define (step)
  .   (if (open? left) (begin (turn left) (go ahead))
  .       (if (open? ahead) (go ahead) (turn right))))
  . (until (gate?) (step))
  . 
The spell holds (chibi). It runs one step a turn; stop ends it.
